# Staged from packages/*/docs by scripts/stage-package-docs.mjs on every
# dev/build run. The subtree under packages/* is the source of truth; a
# committed copy would silently drift on the next sync from cobaltplan.
# Upstream docs are .md; everything authored here is .mdx or .ts.
docs/frizzle/*.md
docs/sizzler/*.md
